          "answer": "no_information",
          "justification": "The report identifies an independent statistician for list generation and pharmaceutical services managing randomization, but does not describe who controlled assignment at enrollment or an allocation concealment mechanism. Sequence generation and post-assignment blinding do not establish concealment.",
